DeepX includes the RPC, storage, and SCALE implementation in a private
namespace. Wallet helpers, contract helpers, and the light client are omitted. The Substrate interface
uses the SDK's coincurve-backed keypair. Storage uses a relative import.
HTTP and WebSocket transport diagnostics redact connection details.
The WebSocket transport retries a closed connection once per request.
